    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a humble neighbourhood shop and grow it into the town\u2019s favourite supermarket</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Your Best Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, plan aisles to control traffic flow, encourage impulse buys, and create an ideal shopping experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194690/extras/093de684658715891d698c3c0116d600.poster.avif?t=1749638437\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194690/extras/093de684658715891d698c3c0116d600.webm?t=1749638437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194690/extras/093de684658715891d698c3c0116d600.mp4?t=1749638437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Know Your Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every town has its own needs. Get to know your customers and stock the perfect mix of products</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194690/extras/755e97243d5e7e5457a3b71a42e0ecac.poster.avif?t=1749638437\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194690/extras/755e97243d5e7e5457a3b71a42e0ecac.webm?t=1749638437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3194690/extras/755e97243d5e7e5457a3b71a42e0ecac.mp4?t=1749638437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your audience or try to find your way to be everyone's favourite </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><